This directory contains supplementary information related to the energy level and transition rate input files for CS in FlorPy.

The .pgo file contains the relevant rovibronic constants for the X1Sigma and A1Pi states of CS.

The input files were generated by careful parsing of the linelist, generated by PGOPHER after running the .pgo file.

The velocity-dependent band luminosities of the A-X and X-X bands are provided here in energy units (J/s/mol) and photon units
(photons / s / mol).

See Bromley et al Icarus 2024 for additional details. The data will also be made available on Zenodo (TBD).
